  triage:description "quality-mgr BB2-QA3-1789251000 (Final verdict FAIL, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1447#issuecomment-5648745882, 2026-09-12T21:17:10Z; BB2-QA3-I1), reviewed at d2a9b6cc5. CLAUDE.md:81's MUST-READ pointer to docs/team-protocol.md still parenthetically summarizes the protocol as '(ack -> work -> completion -> acknowledgement)' -- a fourth, post-completion step contradicting the corrected Required Flow. Confirmed via direct read. CLAUDE.md is the single most-read file in the repo (every session, every agent)." ;
